  "description": "Never trust a video by its size or by prose claims. Extracts N tiles (default 6) at even timestamps and measures three deterministic legs against the strip and the audio: six-frames (the tile count follows the request), audio-bed (volumedetect mean_volume within [-45, -6] dBFS), and a no-slideshow PROXY (hold_share <= 0.40 and longest_hold_s <= 5.0 at a 1s baseline). The sighted distinct-motion leg is deliberately not claimed deterministic. Invocation is the rcos adapter kernel around adapter/run.cjs (needs ffmpeg/ffprobe).",
  "tags": ["video", "verification", "filmstrip", "frames", "audio", "slideshow", "ffmpeg"],
